---
type: "error"
title: "Wi-Fi firmware missing for some Realtek adapters"
status: "In progress"
priority: "high"
date: 2026-07-15
---

A few Realtek wireless adapters (RTL8822CE and RTL8852BE) ship without
the required firmware blobs, so Wi-Fi is unavailable after a fresh
install. The package is being moved into the default image.

**Workaround:** install `firmware-realtek` from the repositories.
